      {
        "id": 225892,
        "name": "joneirik",
        "username": "joneirik",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/j/ecb155/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2019-03-09T01:24:58.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Having just started playing Branch/Claw expansion, and tesiting Sharp Fangs a good bit, I've ended up favoring the Energy Track, much more reliable to pull off the power. And I find the power to be about 50% of the efficiency of Sharp Fang (at least so far). Combine with select place presence + draw power card, it was very rare I needed to reclaim.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Tried going for card plays a few times, every time I ended up burning through cards and having to reclaim much more often, but also struggling to get the power to trigger about half the time, without basically ignoring what the actual cards do and cast them only for the elements.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>So for Sharp Fangs definitively in camp #2.</p>",
        "post_number": 3,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:59:38.623Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
